<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>Sulzer to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sulzer AG said it planned to hold a news conference on Thursday, October 17, at 0900 GMT to give details on structural changes at its Sulzer Rueti weaving machine division, A Sulzer spokesman said.</p>
<p>The Swiss engineering group said in early September that the Sulzer Rueti division was combating adverse market conditions and that losses at the division were expected to be higher than last year.</p>
<p>At that time the company said reorganisation measures and personnel reductions were still underway at the division and would be intensified.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
